        "eta_diff": 0.8
      }
    },
    "simulation_to_reality_gap": [
      "Direct sunlight, time-varying shadows, and artificial-light flicker not modeled",
      "Skin-tone-dependent reflectance and clothing-specific occlusion not modeled",
      "LED beam divergence and photodetector angular response not hardware-calibrated",
      "Hardware validation with chest-mounted LED and wrist-mounted photodiode required"
    ]
